e"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"This photo shows a vibrant street food scene, likely in Southeast Asia. In the foreground, a vendor is handing over a pink plate of grilled meat skewers to a customer. The food stall features a grill filled with various meats on skewers being cooked over hot coals. There's a glass display case containing what appears to be additional food items, possibly fried snacks or more skewers. Several colorful drinks in plastic cups are visible on the counter, with blue and purple beverages that might be local refreshments. The setting appears to be an outdoor market or food street during late afternoon or early evening, as there's natural lighting suggesting sunset. In the background, there are people gathered around the food stall, and the general atmosphere captures the lively street food culture that's popular in many Asian countries. The skewered meats (likely chicken, pork, or beef) represent a popular street food style in countries like Thailand, Malaysia, or Indonesia.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2025-06-08 18:20:31","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/194424926@N05/54574833096\">Flickr</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/PattayaPatrol/\">PattayaPatrol</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-4.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"163283022":{"pageid":163283022,"ns":6,"title":"File:Flame-kissed soya skewers, golden dodo.jpg","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Flame-kissed_soya_skewers%2C_golden_dodo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":1283,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Flame-kissed_soya_skewers%2C_golden_dodo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":1283},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Flame-kissed_soya_skewers%2C_golden_dodo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flame-kissed_soya_skewers,_golden_dodo.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=163283022","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-04-07 12:16:33","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Flame-kissed soya skewers, golden dodo","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Food on skewers|Cuisine of Cameroon|Self-published work|Plantains in Cameroon|Images from Wiki Loves Africa 2025|Images from Wiki Loves Africa 2025 in Cameroon|Grilled meats","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Soya is expertly seasoned with a mix of Cameroonian spices, including garlic, ginger, chili, and nutmeg, before being grilled over an open flame. The meat, typically beef, chicken, or goat, is cut into bite-sized pieces, skewered on sticks, and slowly roasted, developing a smoky, juicy flavor with a slightly charred exterior. It is often served with spicy pepper sauce and sliced onions for extra zing.\n<p>Dodo, with its sweet and caramelized texture, pairs beautifully with the savory and smoky soya. The plantains are sliced, fried until golden brown, and served as a delicious contrast to the meat.\n</p>\nThis iconic combo is popular at grill spots, roadside stalls, and gatherings","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2025-04-07","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Black_Lyn&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Black Lyn (page does not exist)\">Black Lyn</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-4.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"145938937":{"pageid":145938937,"ns":6,"title":"File:Grilled Kefta Skewers.jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Grilled_Kefta_Skewers.jpg/960px-Grilled_Kefta_Skewers.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":1280,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Grilled_Kefta_Skewers.jpg/1920px-Grilled_Kefta_Skewers.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&ut